<Width>544.000000</Width>
<Height>320.000000</Height>
<Position>24.000000,56.000000,0.000000</Position>
<Text>&lt;font color="#000000" size=11&gt;

&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; are the root of most work done in XuiTool.
They are container controls, and will usually be the first thing you put into a new XUI file.
For most purposes, a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; could be thought of as a 'window'.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="86%" bgcolor="#808080"&gt;

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;font color="#FFFFFF" size=10&gt;
To add or edit controls within a container, you need to open it by either double-clicking on it or using the 'Object &gt; Open' menu option.

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scenes&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; also support transition animations from one to another.
Using the timeline, you can specify ranges of frames for various transition states.
These consist of &lt;i&gt;TransTo&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;TransFrom&lt;/i&gt;, &lt;i&gt;TransBackTo&lt;/i&gt;, and &lt;i&gt;TransBackFrom&lt;/i&gt;.
The &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; for a &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; also has these states... which allows for a more general purpose transition, such as alpha blending the whole &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;.

&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;font size=8&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;table&gt;
&lt;tr&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="86%" bgcolor="#808080"&gt;

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;font color="#FFFFFF" size=10&gt;
The &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Buttons&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; at the bottom were animated with &lt;i&gt;TransTo&lt;/i&gt; frames.
The &lt;i&gt;Visual Assistant&lt;/i&gt; (F9) can also help manage &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Scene&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; transition frames.

&lt;font size=5&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;/font&gt;

&lt;/font&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td width="3%" bgcolor="#808080"/&gt;
&lt;td width="4%"/&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;/table&gt;

</Text>
</Properties>
</XuiHtmlElement>
